span.p:
Same purchase path as a customer order:
INVESTMENT_PURCHASE posted, units added to the holding;
fund_sip_runs EXECUTED; next_run_on = next month;
notify INVESTMENT_BOUGHT, audit FUND_SIP_INSTALMENT_BOUGHT, commit

Rolled back; new transaction:
fund_sip_runs FAILED with the reason; next_run_on = next month;
notify FUND_SIP_INSTALMENT_FAILED, audit, commit
